# REST

## Login
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "dummy@example.com",
    "password": "dummy_password",
    "rememberMe": false
}

###

## Register
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "new@example.com",
    "password": "dummy_password",
    "name": "Dummy User"
}

###

## Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "dummy@example.com"
}

###

## Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/profile
Authorization: Bearer dummy_token_here